<title>JAPAN: Daido Concrete to sell Hong Kong affiliate.</title>
<headline>Daido Concrete to sell Hong Kong affiliate.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daido Concrete Co Ltd said on Wednesday that it would forgive 1.1 billion yen worth of loans it made to financially troubled Hong Kong affiliate, Daido Concrete (H.K.) Ltd, and sell its stake in the firm to Pacific Rim Infrastructure Management Enterprises Ltd.</p>
<p>Daido Concrete Co will sell the stake for 426 million yen, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Daido Concrete Co said it would try to attain its business targets, adding that it would announce more details later.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Daido Concrete Co was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
